- Update to version 0.3.0.0:
  + Support APV RAW encoding and decoding
  + Companding (compressing + expanding) algorithm for coding 16bit
    4 channel linear pixel value
  + New profiles are introduced to distinguish between the
    conventional APV and APV RAW

